msgstr "모두 업데이트"

#: tools/pkg/chamesle-store/files/usr/bin/chamesle-store:604
msgid "Firmware"
msgstr "펌웨어"

#: tools/pkg/chamesle-store/files/usr/bin/chamesle-store:605
msgid "Updates for the BIOS, the SSD and other parts, from the people who made them."
msgstr "BIOS, SSD 및 기타 부품 업데이트를 제조사에서 제공합니다."

